			"notes": "# This marks the fourth beta of Assorted Cuisine, for Forge 1.20.1.\n\nAny suggestions? Want to gift us new textures? **[Issues](https://github.com/JuniorWolfgamingDE/AssortedCuisine/issues) & [Pull requests](https://github.com/JuniorWolfgamingDE/AssortedCuisine/pulls)** are there for you!\n\nChanges:\n- Added pies! Craft 'em NOW!\n- Balanced Candy recipes.\n- Fixed display issue with new Cheese Maker model.\n- Added OST/music disc: sisthek/boarddoctor75 - CHEESE.\n- Other minor changes.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/JuniorWolfgamingDE/AssortedCuisine/compare/0.1.2...0.2.0"
